// A capability check. A capsule requests one right; the broker holds the set of rights
// it was granted. The circuit proves the requested right is one of the granted set, by
// constraining the product of the differences to zero, which is zero exactly when the
// request matches a grant. No membership is revealed beyond that it holds.
// Run: zkolang kernel/capability.zkl
public requested;
public grant0;
public grant1;
public grant2;
public grant3;

prove (requested - grant0) * (requested - grant1)
    * (requested - grant2) * (requested - grant3);
